    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But that's the thing... the world isn't waiting for me. It's like the version of me that mattered was the one that was taking care of him. Now that he's gone, the person I was is gone too. I'm just a shell. Everything feels so pointless, like there’s no reason to even bother waking up tomorrow when there's nothing to do but sit in this empty house.",
